    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The darkness does feel like it's closing in. It's not just sadness, it's like... a heavy, hollow stillness. I look at my sword lying there in the dust, and for the first time in my life, I don't feel like a warrior. I just feel like a ghost waiting for the wind to blow me away. It feels like the only honest thing left in this ruin is the cold steel. Everything else is just a lie I told myself.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
